partners to careful selection. She also likens business
partnership to a marriage, which has many benefits but
also takes hard work: “Good business partnerships
are like successful marriages. To work, they require
compatibility, trust and cooperation. Both parties need
to be invested in one another's well-being and strive for
common goal.”

Both Patagonia and Build-A-Bear make extensive
use of partnerships and are leaders in their respective
industries.

